    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear that, but some of our older employees and even some managers are pretty resistant to it. they feel like it's being forced on them and that it makes communication way more complicated than it needs to be. isn't it a bit of a stretch to say it's \"helpful\" if it's creating this much friction and making people feel alienated?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
